{
 "_doc": "Ngạo Tuyết Phái Effect engine records (world-depth Stage 6; ADR-0009). The input to tools/design/combat_sim/put_effects.py, which merges them into assets/data/combat_effects.json under source world-depth:ngao_tuyet. Unpriced. Rule text from design/world/depth/sects/ngao_tuyet.items.json.",
